  <h2>llSetPrimitiveParams</h2>
  <p><b> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">&#32;PRIM_PHANTOM,&#32;[integer</a> boolean ] </b></p>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>• integer</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a></td>
        <td>–</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> enables, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> disables</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>When used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetPrimitiveParams</a> & <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetLinkPrimitiveParams" target="_blank">llSetLinkPrimitiveParams</a></p>
  <ul>
    <li>NOTE: This sets the entire object (linkset) when used in either function.</li>
  </ul>
